Thus we need route_sequence_context_set true. establish_clearance_nominal effect includes route_sequence_context_set true. So after establishing clearance, we have route_sequence_context_set true.

Thus we can attach service window after establishing clearance.

Now we need to validate route sequence: requires candidate_clearance_established, route_sequence_context_set, candidate_service_window_linked, candidate_origin_availability_linked, candidate_destination_availability_linked, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, candidate_task_profile_linked, not route_sequence_validated. We'll have all those after previous steps.

